(deployment-extension)
*method rk4-fixed
*trajectory 1 booster start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=1000 alt=0 lat=0 long=0 vel=1 gama=90 psi=90
  *segment 1 powered
    *when time>1 goto 2
  *segment 2 coast
    *when alt<0 stop

*trajectory 2 payload start on 1
  *deployed from trajectory 1, segment 1, wt=250
  *segment 1 payload-coast
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
